WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.650
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:13.950
Last time: AI finds patterns, fast

3
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:21.860
Chapter 3 · Show and Tell

4
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:29.080
How does a computer know names?

5
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:37.710
Meet Arjun and his little sister, Pihu

6
00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:46.140
"This is a mango!" … "Mango!"

7
00:00:46.140 --> 00:01:00.160
More cards, more names. Pihu learns them all!

8
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:08.280
How did Pihu learn those words? Think!

9
00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:21.290
Show the picture, tell the name!

10
00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:29.940
Label = a name stuck on an example

11
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:39.020
Picture = the example. Word = its label.

12
00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:49.350
Many examples, right names = labelled data

13
00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:54.820
Show and tell: every card gets its name

14
00:01:54.820 --> 00:02:04.890
Mango → "mango". Auto-rickshaw → "auto"

15
00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:12.780
A parrot card. What should Arjun say?

16
00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:20.720
"This is a bird!" The name matches.

17
00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:33.550
Which label fits this picture?

18
00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:42.820
Mango! The label matches the picture.

19
00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:50.810
AI learns names the same way!

20
00:02:50.810 --> 00:03:06.250
Lots of pictures, each labelled "apple"

21
00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:15.940
It finds the pattern: like this = apple

22
00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:29.250
Labels tell AI what each example is

23
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:37.860
Cousin Kabir labels the banana "bus"!

24
00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:46.570
Pihu learns: banana = "bus"

25
00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:56.040
A banana? "Bus!" A real bus? Confused!

26
00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:01.280
What went wrong? Think!

27
00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:16.700
Wrong name! The card was mislabelled.

28
00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:24.140
Train AI on bananas labelled "bus"

29
00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:34.930
AI learns: yellow, curved things = bus!

30
00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:46.520
Wrong labels teach wrong things

31
00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:53.180
Be a label checker!

32
00:04:53.180 --> 00:05:09.230
Which card has the wrong label?

33
00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:20.250
Cat labelled "dog" is wrong! Fix it: "cat"

34
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:32.930
Check every label before training!

35
00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:36.630
Your turn: practice check

36
00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:49.440
Banana labelled "bus": what goes wrong later?

37
00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:59.830
It may call a banana a bus, or miss a real bus

38
00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:04.250
A label is the name on an example

39
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.860
AI learns from labelled examples

40
00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:11.060
Wrong labels teach wrong things

41
00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:14.050
Check labels before teaching

42
00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:18.940
Chapter 3 done!

43
00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:25.740
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
